  Why: 'Every metre of it bares at a spring low (-2.2) and floods at a neap high (+0.99): the same band as the Bar-Head and Lagoon Flats. At mean tide it is sea to the cliffs'' feet; at a low the stacks stand on it. (terrain pass 9 part 2, p2_data.py sha256 15750c11...; PR 5w, on the ground file: paint only)'
